 "Which provisions authorize this VOC standard for adhesive tape manufacturing?",
 ["Articles 20-2, 22 and 23-2 of the Air Pollution Control Act","Articles 20-1, 21 and 24-2 of the Air Pollution Control Act","Articles 18-5, 22 and 31-2 of the Air Pollution Control Act","Articles 20-2 and 23-1 of the Toxic Chemical Substances Act"],
